  "_meta": {
    "scenario": "water-family",
    "notes": "Operator-requested colour-spread render for the 'water family' of resources (local_docs/design/2026-08-08-resource-colour-system.md, gonogo main repo): shows Water, WasteWater, Waste, CarbonDioxide, and Oxygen (for contrast) side-by-side so an operator can see how they currently colour before deciding whether WasteWater should get its own hue. RENDER-ONLY: does not change resourceColor.ts. Like 03-resource-colour-spread, this is NOT a realistic Kerbalism profile: WasteWater/Waste/CarbonDioxide are declared Supply + non-pooled here purely to earn a per-part meter for the render (a real Kerbalism profile usually classifies these as byproducts rather than life-support Supplies, and often pools them). Expected current colouring: Water blue, WasteWater/Waste/CarbonDioxide all the same olive (WasteWater's name contains 'waste', which matches the CURATED co2/waste family before the water family gets a chance), Oxygen cyan."
